DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
5716::$$$message_0039_0000_0000$$$::"Thank you for taking the trouble, Shirou."[lr]::
5717::$$$message_0039_0000_0001$$$::"Hey, I barged in on you, so the least I could do is bring tea."[lr]::
5718::$$$message_0039_0000_0002$$$::Rider bows her head in thanks, taking her teacup from the tray.[lr]::
5719::$$$message_0039_0000_0003$$$::Each teacup reflects its owner's preferences. Tohsaka has a cat print, Sakura's is fancy china, Saber's has wavy patterns, and Rider's is a large Bizen-style cup.[lr]::
5720::$$$message_0039_0000_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服03a(中) textoff=0]It goes without saying that Fuji-nee's has a bold tiger stripe pattern.::
5721::$$$message_0039_0001_0000$$$::"Okay..."[lr]::
5722::$$$message_0039_0001_0001$$$::I'll spend the afternoon reading for leisure.[lr]::
5723::$$$message_0039_0001_0002$$$::...That said, it would be rude to just barge in, borrow a book, and leave.[lr]::
5724::$$$message_0039_0001_0003$$$::Rider's the biggest bookworm in the house, and she doesn't seem to mind when I do that. But I start innocently thinking of other ways to kill the time.::
5725::$$$message_0039_0002_0000$$$::"...Something seems to be on your mind."[lr]::
5726::$$$message_0039_0002_0001$$$::"No, I'm actually pretty relaxed right now."[lr]::
5727::$$$message_0039_0002_0002$$$::"...You want to invite me to go somewhere?"[lr]::
5728::$$$message_0039_0002_0003$$$::I'm not sure how to answer that.[lr]::
5729::$$$message_0039_0002_0004$$$::I'd be lying if I said I didn't want to go somewhere with her.::
5730::$$$message_0039_0003_0000$$$::"Mrgh. Don't tease me like that."[lr]::
5731::$$$message_0039_0003_0001$$$::"I didn't mean to. [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服02a(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服02a(中) textoff=0]By the way, Shirou."[lr]::
5732::$$$message_0039_0003_0002$$$::"What?"[lr]::
5733::$$$message_0039_0003_0003$$$::"Do you know of the pool in Shinto?"[lr]::
5734::$$$message_0039_0003_0004$$$::"Ahh... Waku Waku Zabuun, right?"::
5735::$$$message_0039_0004_0000$$$::Waku Waku Zabuun markets itself as an all-weather, all-inclusive indoor water park and resort. The way it's marked reminds me of okonomiyaki made with the most expensive flour and eggs, coated with gold leaf and wrapped in a fancy box with a ribbon. In short, it's a pool.[lr]::
5736::$$$message_0039_0004_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01b(中) textoff=0]At some point, construction on it finished in Shinto. I wonder what all the buzz is about it.::
5737::$$$message_0039_0005_0000$$$::"It's been a while since it opened, right?"[lr]::
5738::$$$message_0039_0005_0001$$$::"Yes. I was also surprised when I found it. It's convenient that it's open in all seasons, rain or shine."[lr]::
5739::$$$message_0039_0005_0002$$$::I nod. It's certainly a high-handed concept.[lr]::
5740::$$$message_0039_0005_0003$$$::I'm a little surprised to hear Rider bring it up, though.::
5741::$$$message_0039_0006_0000$$$::"Have you been, Rider?"[lr]::
5742::$$$message_0039_0006_0001$$$::"Yes, twice."[lr]::
5743::$$$message_0039_0006_0002$$$::Oh, another surprise.[lr]::
5744::$$$message_0039_0006_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01b(中) textoff=0]Which means the most adult person in the Emiya household, Rider, wore a swimsuit. Now that sounds like a sight worth seeing.::
5745::$$$message_0039_0007_0000$$$::"Huh... You have a swimsuit, Rider?"[lr]::
5746::$$$message_0039_0007_0001$$$::"Sakura and I picked it out together when we went shopping. [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01d(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01d(中) textoff=0]Are you interested in it, Shirou?"[lr]::
5747::$$$message_0039_0007_0002$$$::...H-her flirtatious glance leaves me unable to play it cool.[lr]::
5748::$$$message_0039_0007_0003$$$::[chgfg time=200 storage=ライダー私服01c(中) textoff=0]Rider in a swimsuit would be like an oni and an iron club, or Saber with Excalibur. Utterly invincible.::
5749::$$$message_0039_0008_0000$$$::"I am, but...[lr]::
5750::$$$message_0039_0008_0001$$$::Was there a commotion at all when you went to Zabuun?"[lr]::
5751::$$$message_0039_0008_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01e(中) textoff=0]I know I'd make one.::
5752::$$$message_0039_0009_0000$$$::"Yes... Many men tried to talk to me."[lr]::
5753::$$$message_0039_0009_0001$$$::"That's what I'd expect... You went to the pool alone, huh..."::
5754::$$$message_0039_0010_0000$$$::"Well... I get nostalgic for swimming from time to time."[lr]::
5755::$$$message_0039_0010_0001$$$::I nod.[lr]::
5756::$$$message_0039_0010_0002$$$::I imagine the deep blue Aegean Sea and the stark white temples of her homeland.::
5757::$$$message_0039_0011_0000$$$::"It was still an interesting place. Perhaps a good spot to invite a woman,"[lr]::
5758::$$$message_0039_0011_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服03e(中) textoff=0]she suggests, smiling.[lr]::
5759::$$$message_0039_0011_0002$$$::A pool date with a girl. It's so clichéd it feels illegal.::
5760::$$$message_0039_0012_0000$$$::But...[lr]::
5761::$$$message_0039_0012_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
5762::$$$message_0039_0012_0002$$$::She's talking about it like it doesn't even concern her, yet she's curious. I decide to shoot for the moon.[lr]::
5763::$$$message_0039_0012_0003$$$::"Mm, do you want to go together, Rider?"::
5764::$$$message_0039_0013_0000$$$::"Together?[lr]::
5765::$$$message_0039_0013_0001$$$::Well...[cacheimage storage=ライダー私服03c(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg storage=ライダー私服03c(中) time=200 textoff=0] No, we'd better not. I feel that it would be a disservice to many other people."::
5766::$$$message_0039_0014_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服03a(中) textoff=0]...I knew it was a long shot, and in the end I didn't get the answer I wanted. Figures.::
5767::$$$message_0039_0015_0000$$$::"So you're okay if Sakura comes along?"[lr]::
5768::$$$message_0039_0015_0001$$$::"If Sakura is going, I think you would have a better time without me."[lr]::
5769::$$$message_0039_0015_0002$$$::"Yeah... But I wouldn't be able to appreciate your swimsuit."[lr]::
5770::$$$message_0039_0015_0003$$$::Too bad.[lr]::
5771::$$$message_0039_0015_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服03a(中) textoff=0]I won't be able to persuade Rider.[lr]::
5772::$$$message_0039_0015_0005$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服03b(中) textoff=0]Seeing my dejection, Rider sips her tea and chuckles.::
5773::$$$message_0039_0016_0000$$$::"Don't be sad, Shirou.[lr]::
5774::$$$message_0039_0016_0001$$$::We may encounter each other at the pool by chance, if you're lucky."[lr]::
5775::$$$message_0039_0016_0002$$$::"I'll keep my hopes up, then..."[lr]::
5776::$$$message_0039_0016_0003$$$::If I don't lose hope, I might get to see Rider in her swimsuit someplace, someday.[lr]::
5777::$$$message_0039_0016_0004$$$::I bet she strikes a hell of a figure.::
5778::$$$message_0039_0017_0000$$$::...Hold on.[lr]::
5779::$$$message_0039_0017_0001$$$::I just tried to imagine it, and realized a major problem.::
5780::$$$message_0039_0018_0000$$$::"Rider, wait."[lr]::
5781::$$$message_0039_0018_0001$$$::"What is it, Shirou?"[lr]::
5782::$$$message_0039_0018_0002$$$::"What do you do with your glasses when you're at the pool?"::
5783::$$$message_0039_0019_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01b(中) textoff=0]She can't keep them on all the time while swimming, but she has those Mystic Eyes.[lr]::
5784::$$$message_0039_0019_0001$$$::They're supposed to be a special class of eyes that even she can't control whenever she takes the glasses off[line len=2]::
5785::$$$message_0039_0020_0000$$$::Wait, does she wear a blindfold with the swimsuit?[lr]::
5786::$$$message_0039_0020_0001$$$::She already stands out in her usual Servant outfit, and the blindfold just ups the sexiness. That sounds way too dangerous with a swimsuit!::
5787::$$$message_0039_0021_0000$$$::Rider laughs.[lr]::
5788::$$$message_0039_0021_0001$$$::"Who knows?"[lr]::
5789::$$$message_0039_0021_0002$$$::"Rider! It's an important question!"::
5790::$$$message_0039_0022_0000$$$::"Rin said that women with many secrets are more beautiful, so I will take a page from her."[lr]::
5791::$$$message_0039_0022_0001$$$::"Wait, what!? N-now I'm [font italic=true]really[font italic=false] curious!"::
905733::$$$message_9039_0003_0003$$$::"Do you know of the pool in Shinto?"[r]::

